# Wave T40 (Clover kit): battenroof — BOARD-AND-BATTEN GREEN TIMBER roof: vertical timber boards in the town-style greens (the shipped twinleaf roof palette #7a9a4d/#5d7d3a/#4f6b2f) with darker batten strips over the seams, a lit top edge, and a wooden eaves beam along the foot. A vertical board course is structurally unlike every shipped roof family — no shingle courses, no scales, no thatch, no canvas, no slabs. Worn by Clover's two houses and its two facade cottages. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T40-CLOVER-PLAN.md §5.)
